            "type": "note",
            "text": "LibGONODES Parameters Demo Patch — params_test.gnpatch\n\nUsed by the params_demo example to exercise the full C API:\n  • Parameter get/set on noise1, text1, constant1\n  • CHOP injection (host_lfo, host_chop, host_wave)\n  • DAT injection (host_dat)\n  • Texture output (host_out_tex from noise1)\n  • CHOP output (host_out_chop from host_chop passthrough)\n  • DAT output (host_out_dat from host_dat passthrough)\n\nHost I/O manifest declares 3 CHOP + 1 DAT inputs, 1 TOP + 1 CHOP + 1 DAT outputs.",
